<li style="margin-bottom: 2px;"><a href="https://diyekonustu.com/rss-servisleri" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">RSS Servisleri</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div>
<h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide" style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Politikalar</h4>
<ul class="space-y-1" style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 2px;"><a href="/gizlilik-politikasi" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#000'" onmouseout="this.style.color=''">Gizlilik Politikası</a></li>
