<h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide" style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Sosyal Medya</h4>
<ul class="space-y-1" style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 2px;"><a href="https://x.com/diyekonustucom" target="_blank" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#000'" onmouseout="this.style.color=''">X (Twitter)</a></li>
